    "The development to which this permission relates shall be carried out in accordance with the materials specified on the approved plans and on the submitted application form unless otherwise agreed in writing by the local planning authority.\r\rReason: To ensure a satisfactory appearance on completion of the development, in accordance with Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8 and DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin before the expiration of three years from the date of the original planning permission ref: 24/03206/FUL dated 14.03.2025.\r\rReason: This is required by Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).",
    "The development hereby approved shall be carried out in accordance with the Reasonable Exception Statement hereby approved and thereafter maintained.\r\rReason: In the interests of Fire Safety and to ensure the safety of all building users in accordance with Policy D12 (Fire safety) of the London Plan 2021.",
    "Any external lighting installed at the site shall be angled so as to prevent any spillage or glare beyond the site's boundaries.\r\rReason: To ensure satisfactory living conditions for neighbouring occupiers, in accordance with policy DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012.\r"
